# Backend runtime cache — currently ~49k files (rendered JS bundles for
# menu-scraping browser fallback), regenerated automatically, never meant
# to be committed. Previously ungitignored, so a `git status`/`git add .`
# would pick up tens of thousands of cache files.
backend/app/data/cache/

